  "description": "The Nulane ONE's frame is a masterpiece of elegant form combined with practical function. We've taken our High Performance Aluminium and crafted it into an elegant structure with Smooth Welding and carefully chosen tube profiles. The integrated seat clamp and Semi-Internal Cable Routing complement the clean aesthetic, and we finished off with an aluminium fork. But it's not just great to look at. There's clearance for 50mm tyres – 45mm with mudguards fitted – and extra mounting points on the top tube for optional accessories like a frame bag or multi-tool, as well as all the usual attachment points for carrier and mudguards. It's the best of all worlds.",
